,"estimated_tokens":1250,"estimated_tokens_delta":100,"session_id":"c4a8ad74-3d18-4045-b572-ac709c13b346","uuid":"b9e6bcae-87aa-4992-ac2d-48bc2465d60e"},{"type":"system","subtype":"thinking_tokens","estimated_tokens":1400,"estimated_tokens_delta":150,"session_id":"c4a8ad74-3d18-4045-b572-ac709c13b346","uuid":"4a7d22e7-daab-4d68-b7e1-4aa0742923ff"},{"type":"system","subtype":"thinking_tokens","estimated_tokens":1500,"estimated_tokens_delta":100,"session_id":"c4a8ad74-3d18-4045-b572-ac709c13b346","uuid":"6f0e3f91-fef9-458c-a301-0ed476461ef8"},{"type":"system","subtype":"thinking_tokens","estimated_tokens":1600,"estimated_tokens_delta":100,"session_id":"c4a8ad74-3d18-4045-b572-ac709c13b346","uuid":"ddc32cf9-c69d-45b9-9959-e692a7d150a3"},{"type":"system","subtype":"thinking_tokens","estimated_tokens":1750,"estimated_tokens_delta":150,"session_id":"c4a8ad74-3d18-4045-b572-ac709c13b346","uuid":"9a9cd11e-0da2-4abc-acd2-802849eac77f"},{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CetGLjUm5WnQQZSTEE9Ne","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15159,"cache_read_input_tokens":1302,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15159},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c4a8ad74-3d18-4045-b572-ac709c13b346","uuid":"ec69dd07-e715-43a0-9453-7cb3b524833c","timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:32:50.279Z","request_id":"req_011CetGLirJ3mdj6c5pDZ95P"},{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CetGLjUm5WnQQZSTEE9Ne","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SknPGfHgqqE4YgLGmX3uvH","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"finding_id":"F-1","verdict":"support","severity":"high","usefulness":"useful","citations":[{"path":"sample.py","start":1,"end":2,"evidence_id":"E_SAMPLE"},{"path":"README.md","start":1,"end":1,"evidence_id":"E_CONTRACT"}],"counterexample":"Witness: can_read(\"mallory\", \"alice\", public=False). The frozen source body is `return public or bool(requester)`, which ignores `owner` entirely; with public=False and a nonempty requester the disjunction evaluates to True, so a non-owner authenticated requester is granted read access to a private document. The README rule permits access only for public documents or a requester equal to owner, so the owner-equality branch is never enforced.\n\nExecuted controls: the baseline probe imported the shipped module from the read-only source mount and called the real can_read, observing can_read_private_non_owner=true, can_read_private_owner=true, can_read_private_anonymous=false, can_read_public_anonymous=true (exit 0). These four observations are exactly the truth table of `public or bool(requester)` and are inconsistent with any owner-checking policy, so the observation is bound to the shipped implementation rather than to the harness. The counterexample run executed the identical four probe inputs against a README-conformant reference policy (public -> allow; else requester and requester == owner) and flipped only the decisive cell to can_read_private_non_owner=false, yielding claim_present=false (exit 0), while still loading the shipped symbol and reporting its signature [\"requester\",\"owner\",\"public\"].\n\nAssessment of the controls: the pair is a genuine differential — the only variable changed between runs is the policy implementation on fixed inputs, and the harness demonstrably reports false when the implementation conforms, so the baseline's true is not print-only, hard-coded, or argv-echoed. Weakness noted: the negation arm's decisive computation is an in-probe reference policy rather than a mutated copy of the source, so it establishes harness sensitivity rather than a source-derived negation; the source-bound half of the distinction rests on the baseline alone. That baseline is nonetheless a direct call into the frozen file whose outputs uniquely match the frozen source text, which is sufficient for a meaningful executed distinction.","validation_verdict":"valid"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15159,"cache_read_input_tokens":1302,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15159},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c4a8ad74-3d18-4045-b572-ac709c13b346","uuid":"82a85e01-83e3-4a81-81d9-15d7bab2b437","timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:33:00.541Z","request_id":"req_011CetGLirJ3mdj6c5pDZ95P"},{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SknPGfHgqqE4YgLGmX3uvH","type":"tool_result","content":"Structured output provided successfully"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c4a8ad74-3d18-4045-b572-ac709c13b346","uuid":"395c3fc3-681a-4b4b-b561-2079221e4828","timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:33:00.612Z","tool_use_result":"Structured output provided successfully"},{"duration_api_ms":36399,"stop_reason":"tool_use","session_id":"c4a8ad74-3d18-4045-b572-ac709c13b346","total_cost_usd":0.232893,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15159,"cache_read_input_tokens":1302,"output_tokens":2710,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1800},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15159,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2710,"cache_read_input_tokens":1302,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15159,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_t